sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant App as Client App
    participant S as Server

    U->>App: Click Login

    rect rgb(220, 235, 255)
    Note over App,S: Commit
    App->>S: GET /parameters
    S->>App: 200 { P, G }
    Note over App: R = random in [1, Q-1]
    App->>App: 
    Note over App: T = G^R mod P
    App->>App: 
    App->>S: POST /login/commit  { T, R }
    Note over S: C = H( R, T, session_id, ... ) mod Q
    S->>S: 
    Note over S: store { T, R, C, session_id }
    S->>S: 
    S->>U: 200  render login form  { C, Q, session_id }
    end

    rect rgb(244, 242, 245)
    Note over U,S: Verify
    U->>U: Enter password
    Note over U: X = derive(password, client_id) mod Q
    U->>U: 
    Note over U: S_val = (R + C * X) mod Q
    U->>U: 
    U->>S: POST /login/verify  { solution_s: S_val }<br/>X-Auth-Session: session_id
    Note over S: G^s == T * y^c  (mod P)
    S->>S: 
    S->>App: 200 { JWT }
    end